68
00:07:24,640 --> 00:07:31,640
[ZH] 它要求一個已經失調的神經系統去做一個平常它要平靜、平衡的時候才能做到的事情

69
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:59,360
[EN]  What actually works is different. Reading the physiological state first, matching our response to the level of distress in front of us.

70
