77
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:35,120
[EN]  That observation points to the core idea underneath everything I'll show you today.

78
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:39,400
[EN]  A regulated nervous system can listen, reflect and choose.

79
00:08:39,400 --> 00:08:43,160
[EN]  A dysregulated nervous system is doing something else entirely.

80
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:45,680
[EN]  It is focused on survival.

81
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:51,420
[EN]  So our job is not to master one technique and use it with every adolescent in every moment.

82
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:59,140
[EN]  Our job is to recognize which state we are looking at, regulate, rising or activated, and respond accordingly.

83
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:03,960
[EN]  That single idea is the engine behind the framework of the Pyramid of Influence.

84
00:09:11,020 --> 00:09:17,840
[ZH] 現在是處於一個調節的狀態,它是可以聽人講話,然後進行理性思考和選擇的

85
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:20,640
