[EN*]  The most emotional state is activated state. It has three types of display. The first is fight, which is a combat mode. This is the best to recognize. We expect that the emotional state will be a big sound. It will be a big sound. For example, the child is screaming, or the child is not talking to you. It will be a big sound, so you will feel it is a good to recognize.

